accurate and standardized real estate-related information.","zh":"根據每月獨立訪客數量和網站訪問量，我們在美國、澳洲、歐洲、加拿大和亞太地區擁有並經營領先的房地產線上市場。我們比許多競爭對手提供更多的資訊、分析和行銷服務；提供最全面的商業房地產資料庫；並擁有業內最大的商業房地產研究部門。我們創建並編譯了一個標準化的線上市場服務、資訊和分析平台，行業專業人士、房地產消費者和相關商業團體可以透過有效存取和交換準確和標準化的房地產相關資訊，持續互動並促進交易。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"A large number of parties involved in commercial and residential real estate industries and the related business community use the services to obtain information needed to conduct their businesses, including:","zh":"商業和住宅房地產行業以及相關商業界的大量參與者使用這些服務來獲取開展業務所需的資訊，包括："},{"en":"Our revenue streams are highly diversified. We are not presently dependent upon, and we do not anticipate becoming dependent upon, any one customer or a small number of customers.","zh":"我們的收入來源高度多元化。我們目前不依賴任何一個客戶或少數客戶，預計也不會變得依賴任何一個客戶或少數客戶。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Our business depends on our ability to successfully provide real estate industry professionals and consumers with comprehensive, timely, and standardized information and arm them with the right tools to use, analyze, and transact in the information.","zh":"我們的業務取決於我們能否成功地為房地產行業專業人士和消費者提供全面、及時和標準化的資訊，並為他們配備正確的工具來使用、分析和處理資訊。"},{"en":"The market for real estate-focused online marketplaces, information, and analytics generally is competitive, dynamic, and is constantly evolving as a result of technological advancements, customer preferences, and new products and offerings. As a result of our unique combination of products and services, we find that we compete with a variety of companies that provide online real estate-focused marketplace and internet listing services, publish and distribute information, benchmarks, and analytics, and provide marketing, real estate portfolio and lease management, and administrative software solutions.","zh":"以房地產為中心的線上市場、資訊和分析市場通常競爭激烈、充滿活力，並且由於技術進步、客戶偏好以及新產品和服務而不斷發展。由於我們獨特的產品和服務組合，我們發現我們與許多提供線上房地產市場和互聯網列表服務、發布和分發資訊、基準和分析、以及提供行銷、房地產投資組合和租賃管理以及行政軟體解決方案的公司競爭。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Commercial Real Estate","val":1787000000,"zh":"商業地產部門"},{"name":"Residential Real Estate","val":1460000000,"zh":"住宅房地產部門"}],"total":3247000000}},"peers":["VRSK","CBRE","CPRT","TYL","CDW"]}}